            "review_title": "Review at Cafe Runam",
            "review_text": "SAJ\n17 contributions\n0\nAngus steak experience\nMar 2020 • Family\nWe ordered some different dishes for dinner, including the most popular dish on the menu, the Angus steak. The steak came out sizzling on a hot marble tablet, cooked to perfection and tasted absolutely delicious! The restaurants environment was lovely and staff couldn’t have done anymore to accommodate us and keep us updated on how long our food would be (we didn’t wait long at all)! The cheese cake was also very yummy!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 17, 2020",
