            "review_title": "Review at Cafe Runam",
            "review_text": "EnglishRose97\nSausalito, California297 contributions\n0\nA Gem of A Cafe- Very Sweet\nJan 2018 • Solo\nFor coffee, tea or lunch, this cafe is a lovely respite to the craziness of Hanoi. Have a pot of tea or a sip of coffee, relax and also enjoy the decor. It’s beautiful inside. As I write this review, I’m drinking coffee (it’s strong!) brought back from Cafe Runam.\n\nRecommend going about 2.30PM and sitting on the balcony. There is a grammar school next to the cafe and it was fun watching the kids jump on their parents’ scooters to go home. It was a great cultural observation for this Westerner!\nRead more\nWritten November 4, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
